The coach's natural voice
-------------------------
The clips in this directory are the coach's phrases spoken by the Piper voice
en_US-lessac-medium (a VITS model trained on the Lessac Blizzard 2013 data,
licence at https://www.cstr.ed.ac.uk/projects/blizzard/2013/lessac_blizzard2013/license.html),
run through sherpa-onnx at build time by scripts/voice-pack.py. index.json maps
each phrase to its clip. Nothing here runs a model on the phone: the clips are
played as they are, and any phrase without one falls back to eSpeak.
